<p>The Factory makes things stuff that have a some bigger/bloody price. That's the point, that's their thing. The only people who <em>may</em> be happy with their interaction with The Factory thusfar is some of the Church of the Broken God, and I don't think they'd exactly give glowing reviews. Either The Factory contacted them, in which case these people just said yes to a random unknown company giving them ghosts without looking into the supplier or looking at the supplies before jamming them into their products, or they somehow contacted The Factory, knowing what they are, and did all those things.</p>
